# #5837, the claimless advance: the split transfer and the receiver's close heads.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestDonorCloseBeforeDrain
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the donor closes before draining its admitted moved-key mutations, so its close head misses one still in flight
PERTURBS: DonorClose
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ dNarrowed
    /\ \A o \in inflight : o \notin dKnown
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
    /\ hoClosedAt' = Max2(hoClosedAt, Max({-1} \cup DonorCloseCovers) + 1)
--- REPLACE
    /\ dNarrowed
\* MUTATION: no drain; the head covers only the donor's writes it has seen land.
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
    /\ hoClosedAt' = Max2(hoClosedAt, Max({-1} \cup (DonorCloseCovers \cap durable)) + 1)
--- END
